slider<? printf("%d", (slnum += 1)); ?>:slWriter=0<0,<? printf("%d", WR_CNT-1); ?>,1{Writer 1<? i=2; loop(WR_CNT-1, printf(",Writer %d",i); i+= 1;); ?>}>================> Selected Writer :
